      <p>National Water Commission (Abolition) Act 2015</p>
      <p>No. 63, 2015</p>
      <p>An Act to abolish the National Water Commission, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
